    {
      "id": "f2n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2660,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 452.49560546875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr2",
      "index": "aU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 559461279,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1317836241,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795798837780,
      "created": 1795798837755,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every record is tenant-scoped (directly or via its parent).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every record is tenant-scoped (directly or via its parent).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f3t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3470,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 283.0518798828125,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr3",
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1148525009,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 512568255,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795798837780,
      "created": 1795798837756,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. API Contract (v1)",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. API Contract (v1)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f3b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3470,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 443.627685546875,
      "height": 472.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr3",
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1012852671,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1023128497,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795798837780,
      "created": 1795798837771,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Auth: OAuth 2.0 / OIDC bearer token\n\nPOST /v1/runs\n    start a run (Idempotency-Key header) → 202\nGET /v1/runs/{id}\n    status, result, cost\nGET /v1/runs/{id}/events\n    live progress (SSE)\nPOST /v1/runs/{id}/cancel\n    stop a run\nPOST /v1/approvals/{id}\n    { decision: approve | reject, comment }\n\nRequest: { agent_id, input, context?, max_cost? }\nResponse: { run_id, status }\n\nStatus: queued, running, waiting_approval,\nsucceeded, failed, cancelled\n\nErrors: 400, 401, 403, 404, 409, 429\n{ code, message, trace_id }",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Auth: OAuth 2.0 / OIDC bearer token\n\nPOST /v1/runs\n    start a run (Idempotency-Key header) → 202\nGET /v1/runs/{id}\n    status, result, cost\nGET /v1/runs/{id}/events\n    live progress (SSE)\nPOST /v1/runs/{id}/cancel\n    stop a run\nPOST /v1/approvals/{id}\n    { decision: approve | reject, comment }\n\nRequest: { agent_id, input, context?, max_cost? }\nResponse: { run_id, status }\n\nStatus: queued, running, waiting_approval,\nsucceeded, failed, cancelled\n\nErrors: 400, 401, 403, 404, 409, 429\n{ code, message, trace_id }",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f4t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 325.5838623046875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr4",
      "index": "aX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1798551473,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1754225631,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795798837780,
      "created": 1795798837771,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Security & Guardrails",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Security & Guardrails",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f4b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 910,
      "width": 434.7897033691406,
      "height": 382.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "fr4",
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1556715487,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 797709713,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795798837780,
      "created": 1795798837774,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Identity & access\n• SSO, RBAC / ABAC per tenant and agent\n• Agents act with the user's delegated scopes\n\nData protection\n• TLS in transit, AES-256 at rest\n• Secrets in a vault, never in prompts\n• PII detection and redaction\n• Retrieval filtered by document permissions\n\nGuardrails\n• Input: prompt injection and jailbreak checks\n• Tools: allow-list, schema validation, sandbox\n• Output: safety, leakage, grounding checks\n• High-risk actions need human approval\n\nAudit: append-only log of prompts, calls, decisions",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Identity & access\n• SSO, RBAC / ABAC per tenant and agent\n• Agents act with the user's delegated scopes\n\nData protection\n• TLS in transit, AES-256 at rest\n• Secrets in a vault, never in prompts\n• PII detection and redaction\n• Retrieval filtered by document permissions\n\nGuardrails\n• Input: prompt injection and jailbreak checks\n• Tools: allow-list, schema validation, sandbox\n• Output: safety, leakage, grounding checks\n• High-risk actions need human approval\n\nAudit: append-only log of prompts, calls, decisions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f5t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2650,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 189.83993530273438,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
